      "index": 0,
      "text": "# About Us",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Our Professional Team",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Behind SDG Railway is a team of experts dedicated to ensuring efficient, safe, and sustainable freight operations. Each department combines experience, innovation, and commitment to deliver high-quality intermodal transport solutions.",
      "embeds": [
        {
          "file": "embeds/about-us--embed-01.html",
          "bytes": 2438,
          "iframes": [],
          "forms": [],
          "inputs": 0,
          "scripts": 0,
          "imgs": [],
          "links": [],
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "iframe": "https://757534514-atari-embeds.googleusercontent.com/embeds/519e65e0e56fcef24f03f43ae5831795/inner-frame-minified.html"
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Mission Statement – What drives us\n\nAt SDG Railway, our mission is to redefine the future of freight transport by combining the efficiency of rail logistics with the power of digital innovation and sustainability.\n\nWe are driven by the belief that smarter, cleaner transport is not only possible — it’s essential.\n\nThrough technology, collaboration, and continuous improvement, we aim to deliver solutions that reduce environmental impact, enhance operational performance, and strengthen intermodal connectivity.\n\nOur commitment goes beyond moving goods — we move progress.\n\nBy integrating advanced digital tools, real-time visibility, and energy-efficient operations, SDG Railway contributes to building greener supply chains and a more sustainable logistics industry for generations to come.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Vision – Where we are going\n\nOur vision is to become a leading force in the European intermodal network, setting new standards for sustainable and intelligent rail freight operations.\n\nWe aspire to bridge the gap between ports, terminals, and industries through seamless digital integration and environmentally responsible practices.\n\nAs part of the Port Virtual Lab ecosystem, SDG Railway aims to inspire innovation and collaboration among logistics professionals, fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Our Role in the PVL Ecosystem\n\nSDG Railway operates within the Port Virtual Lab, a digital learning and simulation platform for logistics, transport, and international trade. Through interactive case studies, users can plan rail operations, compare intermodal routes, and experience the decision-making process of real freight companies.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Compliance & Commitment",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "We operate under the highest European standards of safety, quality, and sustainability.\n\nOur commitment to compliance goes beyond meeting legal obligations — it defines the way we deliver reliable, transparent, and environmentally responsible rail freight solutions.\n\nWe strictly adhere to the Regulations concerning the International Carriage of Dangerous Goods by Rail (RID), the European Green Deal objectives, and the ISO 9001 and ISO 14001 management frameworks.\n\nOur operational procedures are audited regularly to ensure alignment with these international standards.\n\nEvery activity, from loading to dispatch, follows a clear compliance protocol that includes:\n\nContinuous monitoring of safety and environmental performance.\n\nTraining and certification of all staff involved in intermodal operations.\n\nImplementation of digital traceability systems through our ERP for full data transparency.\n\nCollaboration with trusted partners who share our sustainability and compliance values.\n\nAt SDG Railway, compliance is not just a requirement — it is a strategic value that drives operational excellence and builds trust with our partners across Europe.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
